      <h3>About Shipping</h3>
      <p class="pol">For Jewelry purchases, shipping and insurance for packages sent to addresses inside the United States is gratis. We ship Federal Express overnight or second day, insured, Adult Signature Required. 
      For shipping overseas, ask for a quote, it must be insured and generally is via FedEx, Postal service or DHL.</p>
      <p class="pol">Objets, Art and Furniture will be shipped on a case by case by case basis please request a quote. Smaller items may also be gratis, please check the listing. The cost of shipping outside the United States is <b>not</b> included in the price.</p>
      <p class="pol">If you wish to specify NEXT DAY or Overnight Express Service, we would be happy to accommodate you, there may be an upcharge. If you are purchasing by credit card, we are required by the credit card company to ship to only the BILLING ADDRESS of the credit card.</p>
      
